homelab-blackbox-exporter (0.3.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Run the exporter with --log.level=warn. At the default "info" level every
    probe wrote ~10 lines (resolve, request, response, timings, result); with
    18 targets every 15 s that was ~790,000 lines and ~245 MB of syslog a day
    on the monitoring host -- 99% of its syslog, with a second copy in the
    journal, and the 18 GB root disk at 80%. Probe failures are level=ERROR
    and still get logged. (post-cutover #104)

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:20:59 -0600

